     "question": "An inhaler with 120 doses contains 1.55 g of butane. Calculate the volume in cm3 of propellant per dose at 25 C and 100 kPa (R = 8.31).",
     "status": "ready",
     "answer": "5.51 cm3 per dose",
     "steps": [
      "Mr C4H10 = 58.0; moles of butane = 1.55 / 58.0 = 0.02672 mol.",
      "Moles per dose = 0.02672 / 120 = 2.227 x 10^-4 mol.",
      "V = nRT/p = (2.227 x 10^-4 x 8.31 x 298) / (1.00 x 10^5) = 5.51 x 10^-6 m3.",
      "5.51 x 10^-6 m3 = 5.51 cm3 per dose."
     ],
