      "Moles of CuSO4.5H2O = 10.68 / 249.6 = 0.04279 mol.",
      "Delta H = 508.75 / 0.04279 = 11 890 J mol-1 = 11.9 kJ mol-1.",
      "Temperature fell, so the sign is positive.",
      "Delta T has 2 s.f., so give +12 kJ mol-1."
