     "question": "A student dissolves 21.36 g of CuSO4.5H2O in 100 g of water and measures an enthalpy change of solution of +12.3 kJ mol-1. Using specific heat capacity 3.7 J g-1 C-1, total mass 121.36 g and molar mass 249.6 g mol-1, calculate the temperature change.",
