     "question": "What are the units of Kp for 4NH3(g) + 5O2(g) <=> 4NO(g) + 6H2O(g)? Options: A atm-1, B atm, C dm3 mol-1, D mol dm-3.",
     "status": "ready",
     "answer": "B - atm",
     "steps": [
      "Kp = p(NO)^4 p(H2O)^6 / (p(NH3)^4 p(O2)^5).",
      "Top has 4 + 6 = 10 pressure terms; bottom has 4 + 5 = 9 pressure terms.",
      "Units = atm^10 / atm^9 = atm, so option B."
     ],
