     "question": "A 1.53 g steel wire was dissolved and made up to 250.0 cm3. 25.0 cm3 portions were titrated with 0.0195 mol dm-3 KMnO4; the mean titre was 27.35 cm3. Calculate the percentage of iron in the wire to 3 significant figures.",
