     "answer": "97.3 %",
     "steps": [
      "Overall ionic equation: MnO4- + 8H+ + 5Fe2+ -> Mn2+ + 5Fe3+ + 4H2O, so 5 mol Fe2+ react with 1 mol MnO4-.",
      "n(MnO4-) = 0.0195 x 0.02735 = 5.333 x 10^-4 mol.",
      "n(Fe2+) in 25.0 cm3 = 5 x 5.333 x 10^-4 = 2.667 x 10^-3 mol.",
      "The whole 250.0 cm3 is 10 times larger, so n(Fe) = 2.667 x 10^-2 mol.",
      "Mass of Fe = 0.02667 x 55.85 = 1.489 g.",
      "Percentage Fe = (1.489 / 1.53) x 100 = 97.3 %."
     ],
