      "Moles Mg(NO3)2.6H2O = 0.750 / 256.3 = 2.926 x 10^-3 mol in 100.0 cm3.",
      "In the 10.0 cm3 aliquot: 2.926 x 10^-4 mol, giving 2 x 2.926 x 10^-4 = 5.85 x 10^-4 mol NO3-.",
