     "question": "Calculate the total volume of gas, in cm3, produced when 1.00 g of Hg(CNO)2 decomposes at room temperature and pressure. Equation: 3Hg(CNO)2 -> Hg(CN)2 + 2Hg + 2CO2 + 2CO + 2N2.",
