      "Moles Hg(CNO)2 = 1.00 / 284.6 = 3.51 x 10^-3 mol.",
      "Gas per 3 mol Hg(CNO)2 = 2 CO2 + 2 CO + 2 N2 = 6 mol; so 2 mol gas per mol Hg(CNO)2.",
      "Moles gas = 2 x 3.51 x 10^-3 = 7.03 x 10^-3 mol.",
      "Volume at RTP (24.0 dm3 mol-1) = 7.03 x 10^-3 x 24000 = 169 cm3."
